{"1524630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KeepUp Survival", "steam_appid": 1524630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [2841550, 1955090, 1988040, 2096140, 4046130], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KeepUp Survival is a creative base-building and exploration survival game set in a natural world.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The focus is on building, crafting, discovery, and relaxed survival at your own pace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your own survival experience: There are no fixed objectives. Set your own goals, explore the island, build your base, and freely develop your own playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524630/extras/08d6b5b3f4738f74a6cabda98fc6fdba.poster.avif?t=1781800019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524630/extras/08d6b5b3f4738f74a6cabda98fc6fdba.webm?t=1781800019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524630/extras/08d6b5b3f4738f74a6cabda98fc6fdba.mp4?t=1781800019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Island Full of Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A global pandemic has shaken humanity. On this remote island once stood a secret research facility that was meant to develop a cure, but something went terribly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the global chaos, an evacuation flight was launched, but navigation data became unreliable, communication systems failed, and fuel supplies ran low.<br>The aircraft lost control and crashed near an unknown island, by chance... or perhaps not?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You survive the crash and find yourself alone in what appears to be a peaceful yet abandoned world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the island, you discover voice recordings from a woman named <strong>Jill</strong>, who was here before you. She speaks of strange events, experiments conducted within the research facility, and something hidden deep beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the facility, you uncover traces of those experiments... remnants of something that was once human, but is no longer entirely human.<br>The research created something that should never have existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jill's final message ends with a warning:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;I can no longer receive signals from anywhere in the world - except for one final, weak radio transmission from New York. Stay on the island... this may be the last safe place left.&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island reveals only part of the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The deeper you venture, the greater the mystery of the world becomes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524630/extras/7fd3ceb2bde7a7d7cf6cb50c5a42a453.poster.avif?t=1781800019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524630/extras/7fd3ceb2bde7a7d7cf6cb50c5a42a453.webm?t=1781800019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524630/extras/7fd3ceb2bde7a7d7cf6cb50c5a42a453.mp4?t=1781800019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building &amp; Creativity</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build bases using wood, stone, glass, straw, and much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct workbenches, furniture, and functional structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own settlements and creative projects</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting &amp; Progression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft tools, weapons, and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process materials, smelt metals, and expand your infrastructure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate electricity using solar and wind power</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nature &amp; Self-Sufficiency</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own garden (e.g. vegetables, potatoes, and plants)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process resources through cooking and smelting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame dogs as loyal hunting companions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration &amp; Atmosphere</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world featuring abandoned buildings and hidden locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel using vehicles, horses, and boats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and day-night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover clues about the island's true story</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Elements</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger, thirst, and exhaustion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt and defend yourself against wild animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No zombies or monsters in the main game</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer &amp; Customization</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or cooperatively with friends (P2P)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524630/extras/bc2c4867901d57f53b0b9e2374cb4a83.poster.avif?t=1781800019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524630/extras/bc2c4867901d57f53b0b9e2374cb4a83.webm?t=1781800019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524630/extras/bc2c4867901d57f53b0b9e2374cb4a83.mp4?t=1781800019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conclusion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KeepUp Survival offers an open world with no fixed ending. You decide how you survive, build, explore, and uncover the island's secrets.</strong><br>Every decision shapes your own story.<br>Whether you want to build creatively, live peacefully, or explore the island's lore, <strong>you decide where your journey leads.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KeepUp Survival is a creative base-building and exploration survival game set in a natural world.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The focus is on building, crafting, discovery, and relaxed survival at your own pace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your own survival experience: There are no fixed objectives. Set your own goals, explore the island, build your base, and freely develop your own playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524630/extras/08d6b5b3f4738f74a6cabda98fc6fdba.poster.avif?t=1781800019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524630/extras/08d6b5b3f4738f74a6cabda98fc6fdba.webm?t=1781800019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524630/extras/08d6b5b3f4738f74a6cabda98fc6fdba.mp4?t=1781800019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Island Full of Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph