es or monsters in the main game</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer &amp; Customization</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or cooperatively with friends (P2P)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524630/extras/bc2c4867901d57f53b0b9e2374cb4a83.poster.avif?t=1781800019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524630/extras/bc2c4867901d57f53b0b9e2374cb4a83.webm?t=1781800019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524630/extras/bc2c4867901d57f53b0b9e2374cb4a83.mp4?t=1781800019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conclusion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KeepUp Survival offers an open world with no fixed ending. You decide how you survive, build, explore, and uncover the island's secrets.</strong><br>Every decision shapes your own story.<br>Whether you want to build creatively, live peacefully, or explore the island's lore, <strong>you decide where your journey leads.</strong></p>", "short_description": "KeepUp Survival is an open-world base-building and exploration game set in a natural, abandoned world. Build, gather, survive, and shape your own story on a mysterious island.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Polish, Italian, Spanish - Spain, French, Portuguese - Portugal, Swedish, Turkish, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Simplified Chinese, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524630/23ee722bb179a83101f1e8501fd359eeadeb264c/header.jpg?t=1781800019", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam